# Standard game, driven through the real menus. Layout (1400x800):
#   main menu Versus (150,280); Standard row (690,154); Play (808,712).
#   One board: 570 px, x 415..985, y 149..719 (71.25 px squares, files a..h left to right, rank 1 at the bottom).
#   After white's move the camera shows two boards (570 px at x 61 and x 770); after black's, three boards of
#   373 px (46.6 px squares) at x 48, 513, 979 (y 247..621). HUD action row: Undo/Deselect/Submit, Submit (841,90).
wait 20
click 150 280        # Versus
wait 30
click 690 154        # Standard
wait 20
click 808 712        # Play
wait 120
capture game-standard-start
click 735 612        # e2 pawn
wait 40
capture game-standard-pawn-selected
click 735 470        # e4
wait 40
capture game-standard-pawn-moved
click 841 90         # Submit
wait 90
capture game-standard-white-submitted
click 1090 256       # black e7 (right-hand board: x 770 + 4.5*71.25)
wait 60
click 1090 398       # black e5
wait 60
click 841 90         # Submit
wait 90
capture game-standard-black-submitted
click 1282 596       # white knight g1 on the present board
wait 60
capture game-standard-knight-selected
click 351 503        # its time-travel target on the first board (two half-turns back)
wait 120
capture game-standard-timeline-jump
